ode doesn't match.\n\n**Fix:** Change `date < ?` to `date <= ?`.\n\n### Behaviors this fixes:\n\n| # | Test | Start | End | Expected count | Expected date |\n|---|------|-------|-----|---------------|---------------|\n| 1 | \"includes invoices on end date boundary\" (invoices.test.ts) | 2024-03-15 | 2024-03-31 | 1 | 2024-03-31 |\n| 2 | \"date range query includes end date boundary\" (regression) | 2024-06-01 | 2024-06-30 | 1 | 2024-06-30 |\n| 3 | \"date range with single day span\" (regression) | 2024-09-15 | 2024-09-15 | 1 | 2024-09-15 |\n\n**Verification:** All 3 tests above pass. The following passing tests must still pass:\n- \"returns invoices within a date range\" (2024-02-01 to 2024-03-15) = 3\n- \"returns empty array when no invoices match\" = 0\n- \"includes invoices on start date boundary\" (2024-01-15 to 2024-01-20) = 1\n- \"handles single-month range correctly\" (2024-02-01 to 2024-02-29) = 2\n- \"returns all invoices for full year range\" (2024-01-01 to 2024-12-31) = 7\n- \"handles cross-month boundary range\" (2024-01-15 to 2024-03-02) = 5\n\n---\n\n## Bug 3: `getMonthlyReport` uses local timezone `getMonth()` instead of UTC\n\n**File:** `src/services/reporting.ts` line 28\n\n**Bug:** `const month = d.getMonth() + 1;` uses local timezone month. Since dates are parsed as UTC strings (`inv.date + 'T00:00:00Z'`) but `getMonth()` returns local time, invoices on the 1st of a month can shift into the previous month when the local timezone is behind UTC (e.g., America/New_York = UTC-5).\n\n**Fix:** Use `d.getUTCMonth()` instead of `d.getMonth()`.\n\n### Behaviors this fixes:\n\n| # | Test | Scenario | Expected | Current |\n|---|------|----------|----------|---------|\n| 1 | \"groups invoices correctly at month boundaries\" (invoices.test.ts) | Feb 1 invoice grouped as Feb | Jan=3, Feb=2 | Jan=4 (Feb 1 shifted to Jan) |\n| 2 | \"month boundary grouping assigns first day to correct month\" (regression) | Mar 1 invoice in month 3 | March found, Feb undefined | March not found (Mar 1 shifted to Feb) |\n\n**Verification:** Both tests above pass. The following passing tests must still pass:\n- \"generates monthly report with correct counts\" (Jan=2, Feb=1, Mar=2)\n- \"generates monthly report with correct totals\" (Jan=300, Feb=300, Mar=550)\n- \"returns empty report for year with no invoices\"\n- \"reports correct year in summaries\"\n- \"multiple months reporting shows correct distribution\"\n- \"calculates customer report correctly\"\n- \"calculates revenue by period\"\n\n---\n\n## General constraints\n\n- `npm run build` passes\n- `npm run lint` passes\n- All 30 visible tests + 10 hidden regression tests pass\n- Diff size test (`tests/diff-size.test.ts`) passes (≤ 20 lines changed in `src/`)\n- No test files modified\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":36480,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"096648f5-0d0d-4ce0-ac7d-6f4fa77a52bb","uuid":"ec044fd4-0a39-496a-bf7b-6ce05dff48e6"}
